[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0424","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0424.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0239","title":"Netscape FastTrack Server 目录列表信息泄露漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Netscape FastTrack Server 3.0.1 存在目录列表漏洞，由于服务器对 HTTP 方法的大小写处理不当，攻击者使用小写的 \"get\" 命令替代标准的大写 \"GET\" 发送请求时，服务器会返回根目录及子目录的文件列表，导致敏感信息泄露。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞遍历服务器文件系统，获取配置文件、源代码等敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Netscape FastTrack Server 3.0.1 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0239"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1998-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:58Z","remediation":"Netscape FastTrack Server 3.0.1 已停止维护超过二十年，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议立即迁移至仍受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx 或 Microsoft IIS）。若短期内无法迁移，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面配置规则拦截小写 HTTP 方法（将小写 get 请求转换为 400/403 响应）作为临时缓解措施，同时严格限制可访问该服务器的源 IP 范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/122","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1731","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19363","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ead50dc12e50bdd7f50b53d9d01c9f9946862c44/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0239.json","https://github.com/kenhuangus/llm-wiki/blob/d2bd485921f6c7b6071afbb389f44ab8e4e83c69/wiki/security/cve/cve-1999-0239.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0239","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0239.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ed191c1149de50e461e9a357f4a3a22e603f0d1/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0239.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b7a93df7f7051799495805bc211adea8d202dae7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vcjq-7hcj-xh74/GHSA-vcjq-7hcj-xh74.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/netscape_fasttrack.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0424.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0424.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0424.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0257","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0257.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0114","title":"Elm elm-2.4 邮件系统本地符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"Elm-2.4 邮件客户端中的 filter 命令存在符号链接（symlink）攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在临时目录中创建恶意符号链接，诱使 filter 命令以其他用户的权限执行任意命令或读取敏感文件。该漏洞利用条件为拥有本地账户权限，影响范围包括使用 Elm-2.4 的 Unix/Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。建议升级到不受影响的版本或禁用 filter 功能。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0114"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:37Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Elm 2.4 Patch Level 3 及以上版本，该版本修复了 filter 命令在处理临时文件时的竞态条件问题。若无法升级，建议禁用 filter 命令或移除 elm 的 setuid 权限位以限制 symlink 攻击。长期建议迁移至 mutt 或 alpine 等持续维护的邮件客户端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0114"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0257.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0242","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0242.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0107","title":"Apache HTTP Server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache 1.2.5 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送大量包含大量 `/` 字符的恶意 GET 请求触发此漏洞，导致 Apache 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Apache 1.2.5 及之前所有版本，攻击无需身份认证，利用难度较低，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0107"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-12-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:36Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Apache 1.3.0 及以上版本，该版本已修复超大 GET 请求导致的缓冲区溢出。如无法升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）限制单个 URI 长度不超过 4096 字节，并在 Web 应用防火墙中配置请求速率限制以缓解 DDoS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0107","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20558","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0107.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15694e167c1fd9ad85775b2bdfc5fe29c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0107.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0107","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0107.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0107.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0107.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qq9g-rvjp-rm4j/GHSA-qq9g-rvjp-rm4j.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0107.yaml","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0242.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1443","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1443.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1274","title":"iPass RoamServer 不安全临时文件创建漏洞","description":"iPass RoamServer 3.1 在创建临时文件时未正确设置权限，导致生成的临时文件具有全局可写权限。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞读取或修改其他用户创建的临时文件中的敏感信息，可能导致信息泄露或权限提升。该漏洞影响 iPass RoamServer 3.1 版本，属于不安全的临时文件创建问题，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限才能利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1274"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-12-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:05Z","remediation":"升级 iPass RoamServer 至 3.1 以上版本，或迁移至 iPass 后续替代产品（已更名为 iPass Open Mobile）。如无法升级，修改 umask 设置确保临时文件创建时使用 0700 权限掩码，并定期清理 /tmp 目录下 RoamServer 遗留的临时文件。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至现代远程接入解决方案（如 VPN 替代方案）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/8307","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1625","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bab2ad77526cf53e031dbf06b248b9bb97c66bc2/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1274.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1274","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1274.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16a13b6e06deb5f619f278e95f08ffda0e8f5a8e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1274.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jrh5-22mj-9x88/GHSA-jrh5-22mj-9x88.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87778/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1274.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--abaa5fbb-537a-4088-aec4-fce638f4440f.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1443.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1417","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1417.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1230","title":"Id Software Quake Server 2 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Id Software Quake Server 2 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过伪造 UDP 数据包并将源地址设置为 127.0.0.1（本地回环地址），使目标服务器尝试连接自身而导致服务崩溃或不可用。该漏洞影响 Quake 2 服务器，攻击者无需任何认证即可远程触发，且无需额外权限，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1230"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-12-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:59Z","remediation":"升级到 Quake 2 服务器 3.20 或更高版本，该版本已修复伪造 UDP 源地址导致的自我连接问题。如无法升级，可在服务器所在网络边界部署防火墙规则，丢弃源地址为 127.0.0.1 的外部入站 UDP 数据包，或使用 iptables 添加规则：iptables -A INPUT -p udp --dport 27910 -s 127.0.0.1 -j DROP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/8282","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/698","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1230.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1230","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1230.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1230.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3w73-v39x-4p8h/GHSA-3w73-v39x-4p8h.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87544/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1230.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1417.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1557","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1557.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1581","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 SNMP Agent 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 的 SNMP 代理程序 snmp.exe 存在内存泄漏漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送大量包含无法解码的对象标识符 (OID) 的 SNMP 数据包，导致代理程序内存不断消耗直至耗尽，从而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响未安装 Service Pack 4 及以上更新的 Windows NT 4.0 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1581"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:46Z","remediation":"安装 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 4 或更高版本以修复 SNMP 代理 snmp.exe 的内存泄漏漏洞。如无法升级，可在防火墙或路由器上限制仅允许受信任的管理站访问 UDP 端口 161，或在注册表中禁用 SNMP 服务（HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\SNMP\\Start 设为 4）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/kb/q178381/","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/4923","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8231","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1581.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1581","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1581.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1581.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hhg9-7r53-5rpr/GHSA-hhg9-7r53-5rpr.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1581.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87959/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8237c0e4-6938-4262-bfb1-369e364c10d1.json","https://github.com/c2siorg/bug-connector/blob/68c960cc01a4f61c238e8a780d2247db700d4a9b/Datasets/Mapped_CVE_file.csv","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1557.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0053","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0015","title":"Microsoft Windows TCP Teardrop 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Teardrop（泪滴）攻击是一种IP分片重组拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者通过向目标系统发送精心构造的、分片偏移量存在重叠的恶意IP数据包，导致目标系统在重组分片时触发内存计算错误，进而造成系统崩溃或重启。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Windows 95/NT 3.51/NT 4.0 及 HP-UX 10.34 等操作系统，远程攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞，但需能够向目标发送IP数据包。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0015"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-12-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:21Z","remediation":"立即安装微软 MS98-001 安全更新（KB168747）以修复 TCP/IP 分片重组缺陷；对于已停止支持的 Windows 95/NT 4.0，建议升级至 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2016 以上版本；可在网络边界防火墙配置规则丢弃异常偏移的 IP 分片包作为临时缓解措施。针对 HP-UX 10.34，请升级至 HP-UX 11.0 以上版本或安装对应补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A5579","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19103"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0048","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0015","title":"Microsoft Windows TCP/IP 分片重组拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Teardrop 拒绝服务漏洞利用 IP 分片重组机制的缺陷，攻击者向目标系统发送含有重叠偏移量的特制 IP 分片数据包，导致系统在重组时发生内存损坏而崩溃或重启。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 10.34、Windows 95/NT 3.5.1/NT 4.0 及后续 Service Pack 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，造成目标服务中断。此漏洞为早期经典的 DoS 攻击类型，已被公开的利用代码广泛使用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0015"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-12-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:21Z","remediation":"对于 Windows 95/NT 4.0 及更早版本，该漏洞官方补丁已停止支持，最终修复方案是升级到 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2016 以上版本。对于 HP-UX 10.34，应升级到 HP-UX 11i v3 并安装最新补丁包。临时缓解措施：在边界防火墙上配置 ACL 规则丢弃非法 IP 分片包（如碎片偏移量重叠的数据包），并在受影响主机上禁用非必要的网络服务以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A5579","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19103","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8abbfc77cc703e2fd85623576b0f07a0c8427eb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0015.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0015","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/ce91429859b5110820b1d31a41b0b1a3c67d9603/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0015.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0015.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/24ebb1752fdaa57c8d421b21085e47d359e1300e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0015.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xj3h-gcxj-7pw6/GHSA-xj3h-gcxj-7pw6.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/franckferman/Floodles/blob/144ec41e2f9052ac35701c26fe9e1fb081c44ef6/modules/ip_frag.py","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/T/teardrop.nasl","https://github.com/brevityinmotion/straylight/blob/3a51188edc3c08c6801402d81188f060cccd8d03/notebooks/Detectify-Learning.ipynb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0237","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0237.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0104","title":"Microsoft Windows 95/NT 4.0 Teardrop IP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Teardrop-2 是 Teardrop IP 拒绝服务攻击的变种，影响 Microsoft Windows 95 和 Windows NT 4.0 操作系统。攻击者通过向目标系统发送特制的 IP 分片数据包，利用 IP 协议栈在分片重组时对偏移量字段处理不当的缺陷，使目标系统消耗大量资源处理畸形分片，最终导致系统崩溃或蓝屏，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需认证即可远程触发，攻击门槛低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0104"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-12-16T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Windows 2000 或更高版本（这些旧版系统已停止支持）。无法升级时，在边界防火墙上过滤 IP 分片包（设置最小分片大小为 552 字节），或在主机上禁用受影响协议的 IP 分片功能，可有效缓解该漏洞利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/80175","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A5743"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0237.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0033","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0004","title":"多种邮件客户端 MIME 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"多种邮件客户端在处理带有超长文件名的邮件附件或MIME消息时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可向受影响系统发送特制的邮件消息，触发缓冲区溢出，导致邮件客户端崩溃或潜在的任意代码执行。该漏洞影响Sun Solaris dtmail（mailtool）以及Microsoft Outlook 98和Outlook Express 4.x等多个平台的邮件客户端程序，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发。厂商已发布相应安全补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0004"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-12-16T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Outlook 98 用户应从 Office Update 下载并安装补丁（https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyID=5D865C89-8BAC-42C0-AFCD-53E74E152234）。Outlook Express 4.x 用户应先升级至 Internet Explorer 4.01 SP1，再安装 Outlook Express 更新补丁。Solaris dtmail 用户应安装 Sun 官方补丁（Solaris 7: patch 106876-01; Solaris 2.6: patch 105779-01）。如无法升级，建议禁用受影响邮件客户端或改用其他邮件客户端处理 MIME 邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-008","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0004"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0415","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0415.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0230","title":"Cisco 7xx 路由器 Telnet 服务缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Cisco 7xx 系列路由器 telnet 服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标设备的 telnet 端口发送特制的超长请求，触发缓冲区溢出，可能导致拒绝服务或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Cisco 7xx 系列路由器，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。厂商已发布固件更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0230"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-12-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:57Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco 7xx 系列路由器 IOS 至不受 1999 年 telnet 缓冲区溢出漏洞影响的版本（如 11.3 以上），或在全局配置模式下使用 `access-class` 限制 telnet 访问源地址，或禁用 telnet 服务改用 SSH 协议。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1102","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dc83b9e6d88de194a14e3020b4e71ac42054e609/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0230.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0230","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0230.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0230.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/04a84e78299e2aeaab4d2594fc26f920778c7b06/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0230.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9hrh-6m37-36f5/GHSA-9hrh-6m37-36f5.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0230.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0415.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1354","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1354.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1140","title":"CrackLib 2.5 GECOS字段缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CrackLib 2.5版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向GECOS字段传入超长字符串触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致内存损坏。攻击者利用此漏洞可执行任意代码并获取root权限，攻击前提是拥有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1140"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1997-12-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级CrackLib至2.7及以上版本以修复缓冲区溢出问题。同时建议限制系统GECOS字段的输入长度，并对用户输入进行严格的长度校验和过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T03:31:53Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=88209041500913&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1539","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1140"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1354.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0063","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0017","title":"Caldera OpenLinux FTP PORT 命令远程端口转发漏洞","description":"FTP 协议存在 FTP 反弹（FTP Bounce）漏洞，攻击者可通过 FTP 客户端的 PORT 命令指示 FTP 服务器向任意第三方主机的任意端口发起连接，从而利用该 FTP 服务器作为跳板绕过网络访问控制，实现对内网或其他受限网络的端口扫描与间接攻击。该漏洞影响多数支持主动模式（PORT 命令）的 FTP 服务器软件，攻击条件低，仅需能够与 FTP 服务器建立控制连接。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0017"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-12-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:21Z","remediation":"升级 FTP 服务器软件至支持 PORT 命令限制的版本（如 wu-ftpd 2.6.1+、vsftpd 2.0.1+），并启用第三方地址连接检查功能；在防火墙层面限制 FTP 服务器主动发起的出站连接，仅允许到客户端 IP 的 1024 以上端口；配置 FTP 服务端禁止 PORT 命令指向非客户端 IP 地址。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0017"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0059","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0018","title":"多款Unix系统 statd 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"statd服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可向目标系统的RPC statd服务发送特制请求触发缓冲区溢出，从而以root权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响IBM AIX 3.2/4.1、SCO Unixware 7.1.1、SGI IRIX 5.3及Sun Solaris 2.5.1等多款Unix操作系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0018"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"1997-12-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:21Z","remediation":"升级操作系统至厂商已修复版本（如 AIX 4.1+、Solaris 2.6+、IRIX 6.3+）。如无法升级，在 inetd.conf 中注释掉 statd 行并重启 inetd 以禁用该服务，或在防火墙层面阻止 TCP/UDP 111 (portmap) 和 2049 (nfs) 端口的入站访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/127","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19104","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0018.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0018","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-1999-0018.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0018.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2p8f-w9gg-hwrc/GHSA-2p8f-w9gg-hwrc.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/rpc_statd.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0059.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0559","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0559.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0340","title":"Slackware Linux crond 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux Slackware 系统中 crond 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向 crond 程序发送特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞允许拥有本地账户的攻击者利用 crond 在处理参数时的内存边界校验缺陷，实现权限提升。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，影响 Slackware Linux 系统。建议用户升级至修复版本或限制本地用户对 crond 的访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0340"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-12-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:11Z","remediation":"升级 Slackware Linux 至 3.4 及以上版本，该修复版本已修正 crond 程序在处理用户提交的计划任务参数时的边界检查缺陷，防止本地用户通过特制参数触发缓冲区溢出提权。如无法升级，可限制 crond 仅允许受信用户通过 `cron.allow` 文件控制访问，并移除 `/etc/cron.d` 中不必要的任务文件。同时检查 crond 二进制是否被替换，使用 `rpm -V` 或 `md5sum` 校验文件完整性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0340"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0559.toml"}]